  "content": "\n\n<p>FAITHFUL BARS 是一款官方資源包，由 BB Christian 製作，可免費使用。</p>\n<p>將經驗條與護甲條改為金色</p>\n<p>舊版經驗條</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_44bc1c3a-019e-4707-9958-aced9864ca86.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"582\" height=\"16\"></p>\n<p>新版經驗條</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_23480a00-a75e-4660-b9f7-6018aed9dd58.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"582\" height=\"16\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>舊版護甲條</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a0e168f2-ae3a-43b1-9c30-3df90e0506cd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0cdc6fdd-1cd7-40b0-a56d-eb2ef30d70a4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_623e1493-806a-4f17-b052-b150d48aba28.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></p>\n<p>新版護甲條</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d4c491a4-8848-48ef-86fc-329e51fb6b40.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ef462851-c22b-40b8-ba13-a0f56ca75ce8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_61030244-3542-4c7e-9894-d0625d9fe036.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>官方截圖即將推出</p>\n<p>建議搭配自訂的「Vanilla Tweaks」資源包使用，以獲得最佳體驗</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvanillatweaks.net%252fshare%2523MfewUx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂「Vanilla Tweaks」資源包（可自行編輯）</a></p>",
